[h1]AGOT - Freehold Government[/h1]

Restore the government of Old Valyria. The Freehold is an administrative government for A Game of Thrones: its rulers appoint governors to manage their provinces, its great houses hold Dragon Keeps, and its families rise and fall by merit.

[h2]Features[/h2]
[list]
[*][b]Establish a Freehold[/b]: a decision to reform your realm into a Freehold.
[*][b]Freehold Government[/b]: an administrative government with governors, provinces, influence and powerful families. A family's power is measured by its merit.
[*][b]Freehold Administrations[/b]: choose how your Freehold is run:
[list]
[*][b]Dragonlord Freehold[/b]: a realm of dragonriding houses.
[*][b]Magocracy Freehold[/b]: a realm upheld by sorcery.
[*][b]Merchantlord Freehold[/b]: a realm of merchant princes.
[/list]
[*][b]Dragon Keeps[/b]: the family seats of the Freehold's noble houses, with their own buildings, starting with the Dragonlord's Villa.
[*][b]Dragon Lords' Acclamation[/b]: a succession law for the Freehold.
[*][b]Provincial laws[/b]: set how provinces may declare war and manage their borders.
[*][b]Valyrian great projects[/b]: raise Valyrian Spires and Mage's Towers. Dragons can be assigned to help build them.
[/list]

[h2]Secrets of the Higher Mysteries[/h2]
Works alongside [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3446353510]AGOT - Secrets of the Higher Mysteries[/url], but does not require it. With it, magisters play a part in the Freehold's projects.

[h2]Compatibility[/h2]
Load this mod after AGOT. It replaces the following AGOT and base game files, so it is incompatible with other mods that edit them:
[list]
[*]common/buildings/00_standard_economy_buildings.txt
[*]common/character_interactions/06_ep3_interactions.txt
[*]common/decisions/dlc_decisions/ep3_decisions.txt
[*]common/decisions/dlc_decisions/tgp/tgp_china_decisions.txt
[*]common/laws/00_succession_laws.txt
[*]common/laws/01_agot_realm_laws.txt
[*]common/scripted_effects/00_administrative_effects.txt
[*]common/scripted_effects/00_agot_character_data_effects.txt
[*]common/scripted_effects/00_ep3_decision_effects.txt
[*]common/scripted_effects/07_dlc_ep3_scripted_effects.txt
[*]common/scripted_effects/10_dlc_tgp_scripted_effects.txt
[*]common/scripted_triggers/00_agot_gui_naming_triggers.txt
[*]gui/window_my_realm.gui
[/list]

AGOT - Secrets of the Higher Mysteries also edits gui/window_my_realm.gui. When both are used, the one loaded last decides that window.
